# Predictive-PostOp-Recovery-Monitor

An IoT-based post-operative patient monitoring system that uses edge intelligence and AI to predict recovery risks and provide real-time alerts.

---

## 📌 Overview
This system continuously monitors patient vital signs after surgery using biomedical sensors.  
Data is processed at the **edge**, securely transmitted to the **cloud**, and analyzed using **machine learning models** to predict patient deterioration.

